@ The ELITE MALIKS, in their own words.
@ MALIK SHALLUF: goes to DE ANZA with YAHYA; has to go study chemistry with him later.
@ MALIK EL BARASI: hasn't seen you since the last Libyan wedding, habibi. Can you connect him with
@   HAMZA's sister?
@ MALIK SHAGAN: says nothing. Just "…", over and over.
@ MALIK AL BAKRI: TAHA is like a little bro to him. Hasn't seen him since he sat in TAHA's uncle's
@   chair watching GAME OF THRONES in ABU DHABI.

@@ file: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom/scripts.inc
EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom_Text_IntroSpeech:
	.string "Welcome, challenger!\n"
	.string "I'm MALIK SHALLUF of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
	.string "Make this quick, though.\p"
	.string "YAHYA and I have a chemistry exam\n"
	.string "at DE ANZA.\p"
	.string "I'm going to go study with him\n"
	.string "later. Well. “Study.”\p"
	.string "Let's go!$"

EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom_Text_Defeat:
	.string "Well, that's that.\n"
	.string "Can't fail chemistry AND this.$"

EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech:
	.string "I've got to go. YAHYA's waiting at\n"
	.string "the DE ANZA library.\p"
	.string "He says he'll hit his Q this time.\n"
	.string "On the exam. Somehow.\p"
	.string "Go on ahead, to the next room.$"

@@ file: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom/scripts.inc
EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom_Text_IntroSpeech:
	.string "HABIBI!\p"
	.string "I'm MALIK EL BARASI of the ELITE\n"
	.string "FOUR. Remember me?\p"
	.string "I haven't seen you since the last\n"
	.string "LIBYAN wedding, habibi!\p"
	.string "Listen… Any chance you can\n"
	.string "connect me with HAMZA's sister?\p"
	.string "No? Okay. Then we battle.$"

EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom_Text_Defeat:
	.string "Habibi…\n"
	.string "You've gotten strong.$"

EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech:
	.string "See you at the next LIBYAN\n"
	.string "wedding, habibi.\p"
	.string "And if HAMZA's sister asks…\n"
	.string "Tell her I'm in the ELITE FOUR.\p"
	.string "Go on ahead.$"

@@ file: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom/scripts.inc
EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom_Text_IntroSpeech:
	.string "…\p"
	.string "…\p"
	.string "… … …\p"
	.string "…$"

EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom_Text_Defeat:
	.string "…\n"
	.string "…$"

EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech:
	.string "…\p"
	.string "… … …\p"
	.string "…$"

@@ file: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom/scripts.inc
EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom_Text_IntroSpeech:
	.string "I'm MALIK AL BAKRI,\n"
	.string "the last of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
	.string "You know TAHA? That's my little\n"
	.string "bro. He's a little punk, man.\p"
	.string "Love that kid.\n"
	.string "I'm so proud of him.\p"
	.string "I haven't seen him since I sat in\n"
	.string "his uncle's chair in ABU DHABI…\p"
	.string "…watching GAME OF THRONES.\p"
	.string "Show me what you've got!$"

EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom_Text_Defeat:
	.string "Ha! Little punk energy.\n"
	.string "Just like TAHA. Love it.$"

EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech:
	.string "You beat all four MALIKS.\n"
	.string "TAHA would be proud of you, too.\p"
	.string "Tell him to call me. And tell him\n"
	.string "the books ARE better.\p"
	.string "Go on. Your father's waiting.$"
